# 8\. Project Demonstration

 ## EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

 ### 8.1 Demonstration Overview

 The **EduGenie** project demonstration showcases how students can use an AI-powered learning assistant to ask questions, understand concepts, generate quizzes, summarize study materials, and monitor their learning activities.

 The demonstration follows a realistic student workflow from login to learning and progress tracking.

 ### 8.2 Demonstration Objectives

 The demonstration aims to show:

 - User registration and login.
- Student dashboard.
- AI-powered question answering.
- Concept explanation.
- Quiz generation.
- Quiz evaluation.
- Study-material summarization.
- Learning history.
- Progress tracking.
- Error handling and AI integration.

 ### 8.3 Demonstration Flow

```
                EduGenie
                    │
                    ▼
              Login / Register
                    │
                    ▼
                Dashboard
                    │
        ┌───────────┼───────────┐
        ▼           ▼           ▼
      AI Chat      Quiz      Summarizer
        │           │           │
        └───────────┼───────────┘
                    ▼
             Learning History
                    │
                    ▼
             Progress Dashboard
```

